name: The Wheel — boss card stays flipped
author: corpus
description: >-
  Event: The Wheel boss blind keeps a card face-down. Tight Ante 1 event: the boss's face-
  down effect persists.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - wheelStaysFlipped: [1]
should:
  - boss: TheWheel
    score: 45
  - joker: Luchador
    score: 40
  - joker: Chicot
    score: 35
